  "text": "The clear breakdown between design simplicity and professional design power defines Canva versus Figma. Creative directors waste hours fielding repetitive requests from sales reps needing minor deck tweaks. Without accessible templates, high-earning UI designers become glorified asset factories adjusting fonts and export dimensions. Build reusable Canva libraries for sales assets while preserving Figma for technical product design systems. This operational split protects creative focus.",
